<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Feb 24.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Feb 24.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Southampton, Tewkesbury, Avonmouth and Gloucester Mar 111.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Apr/Jun 117.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northampton, and Oxfordshire Apr/Jun 114.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire Mar 95.00/95.50/96.00 Apr/Jun 99.00</p>
<p>Avon range Apr/Jun 100.00/100.50</p>
<p>Herefordshire Apr/Jun 100.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Mar 98.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Apr/Jun 100.50/100.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Apr/Jun 100.50</p>
<p>Liverpool Apr 100.00</p>
<p>Penrith Apr 100.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Suffolk Spot 97.00</p>
